get="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://radar.aripaev.ee/isik/13273/priit-kasesalu">Priit Kasesalu</a><button class="subscribe-button__subscribe"><svg fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="16" width="16" class="icon icon-add" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill="#2d0606" d="M9.25 10.75H4v-1.5h5.25V4h1.5v5.25H16v1.5h-5.25V16h-1.5z"></path></svg></button></span></li><span class="subscribe-button" draggable="false"><a class="subscribe-button__text" href="#">Näita rohkem...</a></span></ul></div><div class="article-footer__left"></div><div class="article-footer__right"></div></div><div class="breakout width-limited"><div class="banner layout-default"><div class="banner__inner"><div id="Module_1" class="banner__slot"></div></div></div></div><div class="block theme-default width-default"><h2>Seotud lood</h2><div class="list-articles layout-single"><div class="article-card layout-default" draggable="false"><div class="article-card__content"><div class="article-card__info"><div class="article-card__info__texts"><div class="article-card__category"><a draggable="false" href="/c/news">Uudised</a></div><ul class="article-card__meta"><li>17.12.25, 09:30</li></ul></div><div class="article-card__tools"></div></div><div class="article-card__title"><a draggable="false" href="/uudised/2025/12/17/aripaeva-aasta-ettevotja-selgub-10-nominendi-hulgast-anna-oma-haal"><div class="article-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="36" width="36" class="icon icon-chart" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path fill="#fff" d="M5.897 34.558h6.759v8.449H5.897zm10.139-10.139h6.759v18.587h-6.759zm10.138 3.38h6.759v15.208h-6.759zM36.313 15.97h6.759v27.036h-6.759z"></path><path fill="#fff" d="m6.866 31.572-1.938-1.633 14.195-16.856 9.738 5.503L40.854 4.994l1.901 1.676-13.353 15.133-9.694-5.48z"></path></svg></div>Äripäeva aasta ettevõtja selgub 10 nominendi hulgast. Anna oma hääl!</a></div><div class="article-card__lead">Äripäeva aasta ettevõtja valimisel jõudis nominentide sekka 10 firmaomanikku, kelle seas on nii rahvusvahelise haardega ettevõtjaid kui ka kohalikul tasandil olulisi tegijaid.</div></div></div><div class="article-card layout-default" draggable="false"><div class="article-card__content"><div class="article-card__info"><div class="article-card__info__texts"><div class="article-card__category"><a draggable="false" href="/c/bors">Börsiuudised</a></div><ul class="article-card__meta"><li>11.09.25, 17:13</li></ul></div><div class="article-card__tools"></div></div><div class="article-card__title"><a draggable="false" href="/borsiuudised/2025/09/11/tehisintellekti-plahvatuslik-tous-vois-teha-jaan-tallinnast-eesti-neljanda-miljardari">Tehisintellekti plahvatuslik tõus võis teha Jaan Tallinnast Eesti neljanda miljardäri</a></div><div class="article-card__lead">Jaan Tallinnast võib olla saanud Eesti neljas miljardär tänu tehisintellekti firma Anthropicu väärtuse hüppelisele kasvule.</div></div></div><div class="article-card layout-default" draggable="false"><div class="article-card__content"><div class="article-card__info"><div class="article-card__info__texts"><div class="article-card__category"><a draggable="false" href="/c/bors">Börsiuudised</a></div><ul class="article-card__meta"><li>03.12.25, 08:50</li></ul></div><div class="article-card__tools"></div></div><div class="article-card__title"><a draggable="false" href="/borsiuudised/2025/12/03/jaan-tallinna-osalusega-anthropic-valmistub-borsile-minekuks">Jaan Tallinna osalusega Anthropic valmistub börsile minekuks</a></div><div class="article-card__lead">Tehisintellekti idufirma Anthropic on alustanud ettevalmistusi üheks suurimaks avalikuks aktsiaemissiooniks, et jõuda enne OpenAI-d börsile.</div></div></div><div class="article-card layout-default" draggable="false"><div class="article-card__content"><div class="article-card__info"><div class="article-card__info__texts"><div class="article-card__category"><a draggable="false" href="/c/bors">Börsiuudised</a></div><ul class="article-card__meta"><li>02.12.25, 18:38</li></ul></div><div class="article-card__tools"></div></div><div class="article-card__title"><a draggable="false" href="/borsiuudised/2025/12/02/jaan-tallinna-rahaga-anthropic-ja-google-sunnivad-openai-d-kurssi-muutma"><div class="article-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="36" width="36" class="icon icon-chart" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path fill="#fff" d="M5.897 34.558h6.759v8.449H5.897zm10.139-10.139h6.759v18.587h-6.759zm10.138 3.38h6.759v15.208h-6.759zM36.313 15.97h6.759v27.036h-6.759z"></path><path fill="#fff" d="m6.866 31.572-1.938-1.633 14.195-16.856 9.738 5.503L40.854 4.994l1.901 1.676-13.353 15.133-9.694-5.48z"></path></svg></div>Jaan Tallinna rahaga Anthropic ja Google sunnivad OpenAI-d kurssi muutma</a></div><div class="article-card__lead">OpenAI tegevjuht Sam Altman on andnud töötajatele korralduse kiirendada ChatGPT arendamist, et pidada sammu konkurentidega Google ja Anthropic. </div></div></div><div class="article-card layout-default" draggable="false"><div class="article-card__content"><div class="article-card__info"><div class="article-card__info__texts"><ul class="badges"><li class="badges__badge theme-discrete">ST</li></ul><div class="article-card__category"><a draggable="false" href="/c/cm">Sisuturundus</a></div><ul class="article-card__meta"><li>09.09.26, 09:20</li></ul></div><div class="article-card__tools"></div></div><div class="article-card__title"><a draggable="false" href="/sisuturundus/2026/09/09/tagasi-kontorisse-kas-sinu-tookoht-on-piisavalt-ergonoomiline">Tagasi kontorisse: kas sinu töökoht on piisavalt ergonoomiline?</a></div><div class="article-card__lead">Sügis toob paljud meist tagasi tuttavasse rütmi - puhkuste aeg saab läbi, kontorid täituvad taas ning tööpäevad kolivad tagasi laua taha. Just nüüd on hea aeg vaadata värske pilguga üle ka koht, kus veedame suure osa oma päevast.</div></div></div></div><ul class="buttons layout-centered"><li class="primary"><span class="button size-large theme-default" draggable="false"><button class="button__element" type="button"><span class="button__inner"><span class="button__text"><span class="button__text__row">Kuva rohkem Seotud lugusid</span></span></span></button></span></li></ul></div></div><div class="block theme-default width-default"><div class="banner layout-default"><div class="banner__inner"><div id="Marketing_1" class="banner__slot"></div></div></div><div class="heading-with-tools"><h2><div>Hetkel kuum</div></h2></div><div class="list-articles layout-default"><div class="article-card layout-default has-bookmark" draggable="false"><a class="article-card__image" draggable="false" href="/uudised/2026/09/11/eesti-uus-limonaad-aratab-valismaal-huvi-see-on-poorane-kui-palju-on-meid-kusitud"><img draggable="false" alt="Fillyl endal tehast ei ole, limonaadid valmivad Lääne-Virumaal perefirma Vinkymoni juures. Fotol Filly omanikud Eva Kaarin Rungi, Keili Sükijainen ja Gert-Kristjan Rungi." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 100px, 280px" srcSet="https://static-img.aripaev.ee/?type=preview&amp;uuid=0f779d87-ea86-5842-89ed-d3c31a694afc&amp;width=640&amp;q=70 640w, https://static-img.aripaev.ee/?type=preview&amp;uuid=0f779d87-ea86-5842-89ed-d3c31a694afc&amp;width=750&amp;q=70 750w, https://static-img.aripaev.ee/?type=preview&amp;uuid=0f779d87-ea86-5842-89ed-d3c31a694afc&amp;width=828&amp;q=70 828w, https://static-img.aripaev.ee/?type=preview&amp;uuid=0f779d87-ea86-5842-89ed-d3c31a694afc&amp;width=1080&amp;q=70 1080w, https://static-img.aripaev.ee/?type=preview&amp;uuid=0f779d87-ea86-5842-89ed-d3c31a694afc&amp;width=1200&amp;q=70 1200w, https://static-img.aripaev.ee/?type=preview&amp;uuid=0f779d87-ea86-5842-89ed-d3c31a694afc&amp;width=1920&amp;q=70 1920w, https://static-img.aripaev.ee/?type=preview&amp;uuid=0f779d87-ea86-5842-89ed-d3c31a6